flowchart TD
    SRC[arXiv / GitHub / Standards / Docs] --> ING[Ingest as UNTRUSTED Artifact]
    ING --> FIL[Cheap Relevance Filter]
    FIL --> RES[Researcher]
    RES --> CR[Critic]
    CR --> H[Improvement Hypothesis]
    H --> IMP[Sandbox Implementation]
    IMP --> AB[A/B / Shadow Benchmark]
    AB --> EV[Independent Evaluation]
    EV -->|No benefit| ARC[Archive]
    EV -->|Benefit| REC[Recommendation]
    REC --> GOV[Governance]
    GOV -->|Reversible config/skill inside envelope| ROLL[Canary / Promote]
    GOV -->|Runtime code| HUMAN[Human approval before deploy]
    GOV -->|Trusted core| SEC[Security-admin human approval]
